OL,3,GNEWSA'I nearly died - now I want to
OL,4,Ahelp others'
OL,5,
OL,6,Fchest pain - a sensation of pressure,
OL,7,Fheaviness, tightness or squeezing
OL,8,Facross the chest
OL,10,FA council leader who suffered a heart
OL,11,Fattack has helped launch special
OL,12,Frecovery classes for fellow survivors -
OL,13,Fone year after his ordeal.
OL,15,FCardiac rehab classes are up and
OL,16,Frunning in Droitwich, and will remain
OL,17,Ffree for the next 12 months after the
OL,18,Fsessions were supported by Wychavon
OL,19,FDistrict Council.
